msgstr "Quan estigui activat, es mostrarà un missatge emergent quan acabi la pel·lícula i comenci la propera."

msgid "When enabled, a pop up message will be shown when a recording starts."
msgstr "Quan està activat, es mostrarà un missatge emergent quan comenci una gravació."

msgid "When enabled, a recording is allowed to abort picture-in-picture mode, when there are no free tuners."
msgstr ""

msgid "When enabled, a recording is allowed to abort pseudo recordings, when there are no free tuners."
msgstr ""

msgid "When enabled, a recording is allowed to abort streaming, when there are no free tuners."
msgstr ""

msgid "When enabled, a recording is allowed to interrupt live TV, when there are no free tuners."
msgstr "Si està activat, es pot interrompre una gravació de la televisió en directe quan no hi ha sintonitzadors gratuïts."

msgid "When enabled, a warning will be displayed and the user will get an option to stop or to continue the time shift."
msgstr "Quan estigui habilitat, es mostrarà un avís i l’usuari tindrà una opció d’aturar o continuar el temps."

msgid "When enabled, allow Samba network access without a password."
msgstr ""

msgid "When enabled, allow connection to access points that don't broadcast their SSID."
msgstr ""

msgid "When enabled, allow each storage device detected to be automatically exported as a Samba share."
msgstr ""

msgid "When enabled, allow the receiver to be powered on by a remote Wake-on-LAN network signal (Magic Packet)."
msgstr ""

msgid "When enabled, allow usage of the NFS version 3 protocols."
msgstr ""

msgid "When enabled, allow usage of the NFS version 4 protocols."
msgstr ""

